[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="MachineSpecies" format=3]
; The Archivist (SwoopBehavior), boss of the frozen layer, a placeholder until the character pass: the keeper
; of the cold archive in the Vault, a reliquary the size of a cabinet. It drifts high over the pilgrim, shadowing
; it; every few seconds it stops dead and shudders (the wind-up), then dives through where the pilgrim stands and
; on past, and hangs low and still after (the opening). Every third dive it turns and dives again at once.

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/machines/MachineSpecies.cs" id="1_species"]
[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/machines/behaviors/SwoopBehavior.cs" id="2_behavior"]
